# Executive Summary

This assessment questionnaire is designed to provide organisations with a structured method of evaluating their readiness for Cyber Essentials certification. The assessment captures organisational information, asset visibility, technical control implementation, and supporting evidence requirements. Findings generated through this questionnaire can be used to identify compliance gaps, prioritise remediation activities, and support Cyber Essentials readiness assessments.

