# Control Assessment Checklist

| Control Area         | Question                                                                                 | Yes / No | Evidence Required                    | Notes |
| -------------------- | ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- | -------- | ------------------------------------ | ----- |
| Boundary Firewall    | Is a boundary firewall in place and configured to restrict unauthorised inbound traffic? |          | Screenshot of firewall configuration |       |
| Boundary Firewall    | Is administrative access restricted from external networks?                              |          | Screenshot of admin access settings  |       |
| Secure Configuration | Have default passwords been changed?                                                     |          | Device configuration evidence        |       |
| Secure Configuration | Are unnecessary applications removed or disabled?                                        |          | Device review screenshots            |       |
| User Access Control  | Are user accounts unique to each individual?                                             |          | User account listing                 |       |
| User Access Control  | Are administrator accounts separated from standard user accounts?                        |          | Account management evidence          |       |
| MFA                  | Is multi-factor authentication enabled for administrator accounts?                       |          | MFA configuration screenshot         |       |
| MFA                  | Is MFA enabled for cloud service access?                                                 |          | MFA policy evidence                  |       |
| Malware Protection   | Is anti-malware software installed on all endpoints?                                     |          | Endpoint protection report           |       |
| Malware Protection   | Are anti-malware signatures updated automatically?                                       |          | Protection status screenshot         |       |
| Patch Management     | Are security updates applied within 14 days of release?                                  |          | Patch history or update reports      |       |
| Patch Management     | Are unsupported operating systems removed or upgraded?                                   |          | Device inventory evidence            |       |

